{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks of letters are falling down. Can you form words fast enough to keep the board from filling up and beat your high score?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valid Words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words must be 4 letters minimum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words can be up to 15 letters maximum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words can be spelled vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are about 70,000 valid words, including many proper nouns and names.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game-play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of every game, the first four blocks to spawn are always &quot;W&quot;, &quot;O&quot;, &quot;R&quot;, &quot;D&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The board starts at only 4 columns wide, when you form a word that spans all columns, the board grows 1 column wider. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the board grows wider, there are more chances for 2 or 3 blocks to spawn instead of a single block. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scoring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Less common letters are worth more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words longer than 4 characters award a bonus that grows with word size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cascades award a bonus. (When another word is formed after blocks get cleared and fall down)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Words that span all columns of the board award a bonus that grows with board size.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single letter forming a valid word both vertically and horizontally awards a bonus based on the letter's rarity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonus Blocks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildcard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340020/extras/a362c29424d6c36c2e027d3405b36b39.avif?t=1747434248\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon landing, wildcard tries every letter, from highest point value to lowest, to see if a valid word can be formed. If no letter can make a valid word, a letter is chosen at random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Column</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340020/extras/99edc88315807e2e8dc8b7c3acf59578.avif?t=1747434248\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clears all blocks in the column landed in, giving points for all letters cleared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Row</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340020/extras/bb76b2df81a2830171e26e407951e9f2.avif?t=1747434248\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clears all blocks in the row landed in, giving points for all letters cleared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Spaces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340020/extras/2d48af984d8e38a9c976506b6c6836dc.avif?t=1747434248\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clears all space blocks on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Grid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340020/extras/3903ab03a3b914be222b4aa39f138b54.avif?t=1747434248\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clears all blocks on the board, giving points for all letters cleared.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340020?t=1747434248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_